WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Mati ya mpfula ma rhelela hi le lwangwini ma nghena egatareni.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Xisefo xi khoma matluka, kutani mati ma hundza.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Mati yo sungula ma ni ntshuri wa le lwangwini. Ma tata phayiphi leyi yimeke.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Bolo ri tlakuka ri pfala phayiphi. Mati lama landzelaka ma nghena ethankini leyi pfariweke.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Loko thanki yi tele, mati lama khapakhapaka ma ya exikheleni xa murhi, ekule ni rirhangu.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Loko mpfula yi herile, humesa mati ephayiphini leswaku yi lunghekela mpfula leyi landzelaka.
